 "MonitoringProgramDescription": "A deed restriction keeps a home affordable, or reserved for people who work in the Region, for as long as the restriction is recorded. TRPA grants development bonuses and other incentives for housing that carries one.\n\nRestrictions come in three income levels: affordable, for households earning up to 80 percent of area median income; moderate, up to 120 percent; and achievable, for local workers at any income.",
